  "stop_rule": "Execute all 896 frozen trajectory branches and all 3584 answer turns once. Preserve failures and every base/task/semantic, route, memory, history, regime, and readout cell. Do not select conditions or redefine success after generation.",
  "claim_boundary": "This constrained four-turn Mistral diagnostic can measure answer-token trajectory divergence under fixed versus self-generated histories for four frozen world/side scenarios, two existing checkpoints, three workspace position routes, two base references, two final readouts, and matched greedy/sampled choices. Full-prefix recomputation tests history-mediated recurrence but is not KV-cache-specific evidence. Candidate-only no/yes generation is not unconstrained natural chat. The assay cannot establish semantic memory, specificity, generalization, capability, portability, serving speed, or rescue the failed grouped F1-F5 gates; the scientific winner remains none."
